<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle trendless - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle trendless - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>There was no trend in the feeder cattle auction due to ast week's Christmas holiday, according to USDA.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs few 52.50; 700-800 lbs few 53.00. Small 1 500-600 lbs 36.00-43.00. Medium and Large 2 500- 700 lbs 40.00-45.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 500- 600 lbs</p>
<p>38.00-43.00. Medium and Large 2 500-650 lbs 33.00-41.00.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,339.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
